 "text": "基于磁链的永磁同步电机控制器，输入 7 路、输出 3 路；按 {Parameterize losses by} 指定类型 Single efficiency；{Control Type} 控制 Torque、{Number of pole pairs, PolePairs} 指定极数、{Vector of d-axis current breakpoints, id_index} 指定电流 vector、{Vector of q-axis current breakpoints, iq_index} 指定电流 vector、{Corresponding d-axis flux, lambda_d} 指定磁链 vector、{Corresponding q-axis flux, lambda_q} 指定磁链 vector、{Sample time for the torque control, Tst} 指定时间 1e-4、{D-axis proportional gain, Kp_d} 指定 Gain、{Q-axis proportional gain, Kp_q} 指定 Gain、{D-axis integral gain, Ki_d} 指定 Gain、{Q-axis integral gain, Ki_q} 指定 Gain、{Vector of speed breakpoints, wbp} 指定断点 vector、{Vector of torque breakpoints, tbp} 指定断点 vector、{Corresponding d-axis current reference, id_ref} 指定电流 vector、{Corresponding q-axis current reference, iq_ref} 指定电流 vector、{Speed regulation time constant, Ksf} 指定时间 .1、{Proportional gain, Kp_w} 指定 Gain、{Integral gain, Ki_w} 指定 Gain、{Inertia compensation, Jcomp} 指定惯性、{Static friction, Fs} 指定摩擦、{Viscous damping compensation, Fv} 指定 Dampint、{Overall inverter efficiency, eff} 指定常量、{Vector of speeds (w) for tabulated loss, w_loss_bp} 指定断点、{Vector of torques (T) for tabulated loss, T_loss_bp} 指定断点、{Corresponding losses, losses_table} 指定表、{Vector of speeds (w) for tabulated efficiency, w_eff_bp} 指定断点、{Vector of torques (T) for tabulated efficiency, T_eff_bp} 指定断点、{Corresponding efficiency, efficiency_table} 指定表，按实例取值。",
